## Waveshare knob: power savings, let the ESP32-S3 sleep
- Done so far: see "Power" in firmware/README.md.
- Left: light sleep while there is no USB host (USB needs the clocks
  running), waking on a twist of the ring, preferably on a tap too.
- Not permitted to affect normal use.
- Not allowed to blank the screen: attract-mode breathing keeps going while
  nobody uses the knob.
